msgstr "短 SHA"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch05-frontmatter-provenance-trust.md:238
#: f04954e976cf49e1b3d7d16bc7089009
msgid ""
"Against which code commit? (Same semantics as frontmatter `commit`; co-"
