msgstr "对着哪个代码 commit 写的？（语义和 frontmatter 里的 `commit` 一致；在这里共处一地，是为了让过时检查便宜。）"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch05-frontmatter-provenance-trust.md:238
#: 5d0dfaf6003742c787f0d0f28971fd5d
msgid "`updated_by`"
msgstr "`updated_by`"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch05-frontmatter-provenance-trust.md:238
#: 7d454320c5224595b92349ffcb59e864
msgid "`human` / `ai` / `ai+human`"
msgstr "`human` / `ai` / `ai+human`"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch05-frontmatter-provenance-trust.md:238
#: f7121098e37b41538c7f01eb18b18db5
msgid ""
"Who did the most recent change? Mirrors the YAML `updated_by` but uses a "
"closed three-value vocabulary so a gate can match on it."
msgstr "最近一次改动是谁做的？和 YAML 里的 `updated_by` 相对应，但**这里用的是一套封闭的三值词汇表**，让闸可以精确地匹配。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/ch05-frontmatter-provenance-trust.md:238
#: 883444b2eb764856ad82639ad35a7c9d
